Required exact first line for every module under `src/`:
```
// woof-acceptance: aa212b11dccc
```
Verified `src/slugify.mjs` line 1 is exactly this (checked byte-for-byte via `od -c`, no trailing whitespace or other deviation). ✅ Resolved.

## Acceptance criteria — checked against `src/slugify.mjs` and `test/slugify.test.mjs`

- **slugify lowercases its input** — ✅ `.toLowerCase()` applied first.
- **runs of characters other than a–z and 0–9 become one hyphen** — ✅ `.replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, "-")` after lowercasing.
- **the result has no leading or trailing hyphens** — ✅ `.replace(/^-+|-+$/g, "")`.
- **tests pass with `node --test`** — ✅ Ran `node --test` from the repo root; all 5 tests pass, 0 failures:
  ```
  ✔ lowercases input
