  fail 0
  ```

`test/slugify.test.mjs` is unchanged from the prior build and still covers lowercasing, run-collapsing, leading/trailing stripping, digit preservation, and empty/fully-non-alphanumeric edge cases.

## Non-blocking note

The repair report raises an objection that the header-marker requirement wasn't visible to the builder at initial build time. That's a process observation about the workflow, not a defect in this change — it doesn't affect the verdict.

## Blocking findings

None.

